    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail in <i>Sneaky Pirates!</i>\u00a0A thrilling online multiplayer social deduction game where deception, strategy, and fast-paced action collide on the open sea! In this high-stakes battle of wits, up to <strong>4 players</strong> disguise themselves among a fleet of ships, sneaking around while trying to <strong>hunt down and steal from their rivals</strong>\u2014all without being caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras/29d94fb5d073368c5b65263a5fca08a9.avif?t=1750285283\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Steal to Win</strong> \u2013 The pirate with the most gold at the end of the match reigns supreme. In case of a tie, the first one to steal claims victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras/f3044951518184a5c0bd3b51ceeb3261.avif?t=1750285283\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f <strong>Hide in the crowd\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Blend into a sea of AI-controlled ships, carefully plotting your next move while staying unnoticed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras/a53777e5e5825072f1867e1235a23512.avif?t=1750285283\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Power Up or Fight Back</strong> \u2013 Use special abilities to escape tight situations, throw off pursuers, or strike down other pirates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras/e77f9276d4fb501c96fded2a2085c2d9.avif?t=1750285283\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Customize Your Ship</strong> \u2013 Buy and equip aesthetic upgrades to make your vessel truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras/0490cf0db065f325f451b488098eb945.avif?t=1750285283\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Choose Your Playstyle</strong> \u2013 Stay hidden and play it safe, or throw caution out the window and steal recklessly\u2014both approaches can lead to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 <strong>No Winner is Safe</strong> \u2013 The tides can turn at any moment\u2014a last-second, well-placed steal can change everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Evolving Early Access</strong> \u2013 The adventure is just beginning! We\u2019re looking forward to expand\u00a0<i>Sneaky Pirates</i> with new content and features, shaped by community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to deceive, steal, and outsmart other pirates? Join the crew and prove you're the craftiest on the seven seas! \ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras/ca6b99c3c8393cfe34a8690638d7f353.avif?t=1750285283\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
