com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras/e77f9276d4fb501c96fded2a2085c2d9.avif?t=1750285283\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Customize Your Ship</strong> \u2013 Buy and equip aesthetic upgrades to make your vessel truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras/0490cf0db065f325f451b488098eb945.avif?t=1750285283\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Choose Your Playstyle</strong> \u2013 Stay hidden and play it safe, or throw caution out the window and steal recklessly\u2014both approaches can lead to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 <strong>No Winner is Safe</strong> \u2013 The tides can turn at any moment\u2014a last-second, well-placed steal can change everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Evolving Early Access</strong> \u2013 The adventure is just beginning! We\u2019re looking forward to expand\u00a0<i>Sneaky Pirates</i> with new content and features, shaped by community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to deceive, steal, and outsmart other pirates? Join the crew and prove you're the craftiest on the seven seas! \ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras/ca6b99c3c8393cfe34a8690638d7f353.avif?t=1750285283\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Sneaky Pirates is a fast-paced online multiplayer social deduction game for 4 players. Hide among ships, steal from rivals, and use power-ups to escape or fight back. Play it safe or go all-in\u2014no winner is safe until the last second! Customize your ship and be the king of pirates! \ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f",
